version 0.14.0
view main

# The project's one print page (ADR-0069 D4). It composes the three module drawings of the
# product and draws the two cross-PCB interconnects the root declares. The module drawings keep
# their own extents; a placement never scales one (ADR-0068 D4).
#
#   M1  charger-power   the BQ24610 power path, on charger-buck
#   M2  buck-5v         the TPS5430 5V converter, on charger-buck
#   M3  mcu-board       the CH32V307 minimum system, on mcu-board
#
# The page draws no component placement of its own: every part is drawn once, in its module's
# drawing (ADR-0071 D3). The interconnects are the only project-level joins it shows.
template a2

interconnect
  ic1  M2.VOUT  M3.DC_IN  [431.5,131.0]  90
  ic2  M2.GND   M3.GND    [390.0,140.5]  90

module_place
  M1  charger-power  [20.0,20.0]  0
  M2  buck-5v        [350.0,20.0]  0
  M3  mcu-board      [320.0,215.0]  0
